Kiro provider protocol references

The native Rust request/history and thinking handling is informed by pi-kiro
(https://github.com/hongyilyu/pi-kiro); API-key routing and catalog discovery
are informed by pi-kiro-api (https://github.com/satiyap/pi-kiro-api).
The implementations were rewritten for Optimus's native Rust interfaces.
The referenced projects' MIT notices follow.

